{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.HeckeConvergenceBound","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.HeckeConvergenceBound","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.hecke_convergence_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.hecke_convergence_bound","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-convergence-bound.lean#L25-L32","doc":"At k = 11, the model error is below the q₀ measurement floor.\nNumerical bound: `predictedMAE 11 = 0.001 * 4^(-8) ≈ 1.526·10⁻⁸ < 2·10⁻⁸`.\nRef: [kassel1995] https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4612-0783-2 —\nnumerical convergence of Hecke-representation approximants. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:hecke-convergence-bound","label":"prop:hecke-convergence-bound","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-convergence-bound.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.predictedMAE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.predictedMAE","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-convergence-bound.lean#L21-L23","doc":"The predicted MAE at Hecke level k. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.baseError","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.baseError","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-convergence-bound.lean#L18-L19","doc":"The base error at H₃. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.convergenceRate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.convergenceRate","kind":"def","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-convergence-bound.lean#L15-L16","doc":"The convergence rate constant. ","signatureChunk":0}]}